    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d334">

                <pb facs="0611" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg517"/>

                <head>No. 334.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Sir L. S. Sackville
                            West to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-04-04"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 4, 1887</date>.
                        (Received April 6.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi> With reference to my note of the 28th of
                    January last, I have the honor to inclose to you herewith copy of an approved
                    report of a committee of the privy council of Canada, embodying a report of the
                    minister of marine and fisheries on the cases of the United States fishing
                    vessels <hi rendition="#italic">Pearl Nelson</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Everett Steele</hi>.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">L. S. Sackville
                    West.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d334-a1.xml" xpointer="d334-a1"/>
            </div>
